(7718102, 1269311, 38032, '<td valign="top">It''s an unfortunate crop. I think if we could get a little more context here, it would be splendid. The hat is particularly interesting though - almost blending into the background. 6</td>', 'It''s an unfortunate crop. I think if we could get a little more context here, it would be splendid. The hat is particularly interesting though - almost blending into the background. 6', '2022-04-04 17:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7718185, 1269157, 173844, '<td valign="top">Every color, line, curve, frill and smattering is as just so as can be.  The light itself amplifies and sweetens.  The comfortable composition, too, suits this pillow of an image.  Nicely demonstrates that colorful needn''t entail saturation.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Every color, line, curve, frill and smattering is as just so as can be.  The light itself amplifies and sweetens.  The comfortable composition, too, suits this pillow of an image.  Nicely demonstrates that colorful needn''t entail saturation.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2022-04-05 21:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7718186, 1269324, 173844, '<td valign="top">The solid greens try to corral this flurry of confetti, to no avail.  Let exuberance explode as it will.  Beautiful and exciting.  Party on.</td>', 'The solid greens try to corral this flurry of confetti, to no avail.  Let exuberance explode as it will.  Beautiful and exciting.  Party on.', '2022-04-05 21:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7718187, 1269298, 173844, '<td valign="top">What a way to celebrate, everyone a part of this colorful, happy canvas.  When it comes down to it, though, it''s the glance of this child, cinched on the shoulders of his or her father, I''m assuming, fingers interlaced, that entrances.<br/>Lovely photo.</td>', 'What a way to celebrate, everyone a part of this colorful, happy canvas.  When it comes down to it, though, it''s the glance of this child, cinched on the shoulders of his or her father, I''m assuming, fingers interlaced, that entrances.Lovely photo.', '2022-04-05 21:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7718188, 1269313, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully quirky, plain-spoken and thoughtfully noted.  Unexpected composition that works like a charm.  Red, green, black and white, all vital and balanced.  Every object is off-center, yet the stage sustains a balanced tension.  And the humble plexiglass window reveals the mighty city, if I''m seeing it rightly, as a decorative will-o-the-wisp.<br/>It pays to glance left and right.</td>', 'Wonderfully quirky, plain-spoken and thoughtfully noted.  Unexpected composition that works like a charm.  Red, green, black and white, all vital and balanced.  Every object is off-center, yet the stage sustains a balanced tension.  And the humble plexiglass window reveals the mighty city, if I''m seeing it rightly, as a decorative will-o-the-wisp.It pays to glance left and right.', '2022-04-05 22:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7718190, 1269202, 173844, '<td valign="top">Can the uninitiated make sense of this stream of consciousness alchemy?  How delightful it must be to come upon this intersection in the morning.  The colors, and the white lines, really stand out against the black road.  There are hints that these bewildering runes continue out in every direction.  Sure to brighten up one''s day.<br/>Enchanting.</td>', 'Can the uninitiated make sense of this stream of consciousness alchemy?  How delightful it must be to come upon this intersection in the morning.  The colors, and the white lines, really stand out against the black road.  There are hints that these bewildering runes continue out in every direction.  Sure to brighten up one''s day.Enchanting.', '2022-04-05 22:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7718191, 1269206, 173844, '<td valign="top">The colors have faded, but in hearkening back through the ages one can infer the brilliance and vitality, awe and trepidation, faith and mystery that once lived here.  That''s more than enough.</td>', 'The colors have faded, but in hearkening back through the ages one can infer the brilliance and vitality, awe and trepidation, faith and mystery that once lived here.  That''s more than enough.', '2022-04-05 22:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
