(7718273, 1269281, 97435, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by oldbimmercoupe:</b></div><hr/><i> Always hard to score a pic of someone elses art. Incredible colors and concept here of course. GL. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>So true.<br/>I loved this artwork so much that I just wanted to share the best version of it, not even realizing that I am not adding any value to it, it''s just a snapshot of someone else''s work.<br/> <br/>Meantime I''ve been looking at the original picture and I think I could have submitted something like this:<br/> <br/><a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1269497" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/95000-99999/97435/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1269497.jpg" xalt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/95000-99999/97435/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1269497.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/95000-99999/97435/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1269497.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''"/></a> <br/> <br/>This crop gives the mural some valuable context, and I think the composition is quite good.<br/>Anyway, next time :)<br/> <br/>For those who enjoyed the colors in this mural, I encourage you to look up the artist''s work, he has a very large and very impressive body of work.</td>', 'Originally posted by oldbimmercoupe: Always hard to score a pic of someone elses art. Incredible colors and concept here of course. GL.   So true.I loved this artwork so much that I just wanted to share the best version of it, not even realizing that I am not adding any value to it, it''s just a snapshot of someone else''s work. Meantime I''ve been looking at the original picture and I think I could have submitted something like this:   This crop gives the mural some valuable context, and I think the composition is quite good.Anyway, next time :) For those who enjoyed the colors in this mural, I encourage you to look up the artist''s work, he has a very large and very impressive body of work.', '2022-04-06 15:30:56.000000', NULL, 0),
